<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 250 million stg May 1998 bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 250 million stg May 1998 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was self-led by Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    26.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.856    PAY DATE   S26.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.075     REOFFER    99.856    SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC   0.025</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
